   "failure_scenario": "Someone upgrades an installation that never set the GitHub owner and depends on automatic Dependabot verification runs. Doctor, init and the upgrade notes say only that issue-label and /limitless comment triggers are off, so the operator has no reason to think Dependabot runs stopped too, and those PRs quietly stop getting runs.",
